sequenceDiagram
    participant Orch as Orchestrator
    participant Gen as Generator VLM
    participant Render as Playwright renderer
    participant Diff as Pixel-diff engine
    participant Critic as Critic VLM
    participant State as Best-so-far state

    Orch->>State: get best_code, best_score
    Orch->>Critic: target, rendered_best, diff_heatmap
    Critic-->>Orch: patch_proposal (one minimal delta)
    Orch->>Gen: apply patch to best_code
    Gen-->>Orch: candidate_code
    Orch->>Render: render(candidate_code)
    Render-->>Orch: candidate_png
    Orch->>Diff: diff(target_png, candidate_png)
    Diff-->>Orch: candidate_score, candidate_heatmap

    alt candidate_score > best_score
        Orch->>State: write candidate as new best
        Note over State: Accept: monotone improvement
    else candidate_score <= best_score
        Note over Orch: Reject patch
        Orch->>Orch: resample (up to k attempts)
        alt k attempts exhausted
            Orch->>Orch: terminate iteration
        end
    end
